# Everything the build does not read. `node_modules` especially: the image
# installs its own, and copying a host tree in would ship the wrong platform's
# binaries — and, while `@lelantos-org/sdk` is linked to a sibling checkout, a
# dangling symlink.
node_modules
dist

# Secrets and per-deployment state, none of which belong in an image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
consumed.log
mcp.config.json

.git
.github
test
*.md
!README.md
